      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-pure-j/q7-solution-3.svg\" alt=\"Continuity therefore places a root strictly between these two bounds: [B1] Therefore the root rounds to 0.099314 . [A1]\" style=\"--madas-width:678.7px\"></figure>",
